                                "sense_id": "aaa1d389-cc65-332f-a54e-41670c39f654",
                                "text": "note(s): For FC, Piper, Elaine, B_A and everyone who asked for more Fuffy. :)"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "dc0c90f8-2aa9-4cf5-95e0-af8e3a03479d",
                                "sense_id": "aaa1d389-cc65-332f-a54e-41670c39f654",
                                "text": "I personally wish Joss will give us a Fuffy ending to the series...Buffy realizing it's Faith she needs to be with."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c2b85730-990a-445a-80c9-5fb249a6dbc9",
                                "sense_id": "aaa1d389-cc65-332f-a54e-41670c39f654",
                                "text": "You guys need to read more (fem)slash. In most of the Wuffy and Fuffy fics I've read recently, Spike is either absent, or plain old pre-chip Evil!Spike."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "61fbee88-1957-354c-b32a-b8c27789e100",
                        "entry_id": "fdd569da-0d42-319c-b00e-c0eaef0fdacf",
                        "glosses": [
