                                "sense_id": "61fbee88-1957-354c-b32a-b8c27789e100",
                                "text": "With regard to favorite scenes, I have to say I liked the scene where Riley and Fuffy (is that what you guys call Faith-in-Buffy's-body?) slept together."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4fb461ab-d5a8-417d-baa9-64a6279c9189",
                                "sense_id": "61fbee88-1957-354c-b32a-b8c27789e100",
                                "text": "Tara displayed some remarkable perceptiveness in \"Who are You\" realizing that Fuffy wasn't Buffy."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f177a5f7-8a0f-4416-8c74-615f4f6578eb",
                                "sense_id": "61fbee88-1957-354c-b32a-b8c27789e100",
                                "text": "The only chemistry I ever noticed between Spike and Buffy was when she was Fuffy."
                            }
